{
  "name": "WhatsApp Offer Bot - Main",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp Offer Bot – Main\n\n**Flow:**\n1. WhatsApp Trigger (Webhook von Meta Cloud API)\n2. Whitelist-Check (interne Mitarbeiter-Telefonnummern)\n3. Voice -> Whisper Transcribe; Text -> direkt\n4. AI Agent (gpt-4o) mit Memory + 4 Tools:\n   - `lookup_material` (HTTP Tool -> ERP)\n   - `get_verrechnungssaetze` (HTTP Tool -> ERP)\n   - `send_offer_to_whatsapp` (Sub-Workflow)\n   - `send_offer_email` (Sub-Workflow)\n5. Agent-Antwort zurueck per WhatsApp\n\n**Vor Aktivierung setzen:**\n- WhatsApp-Credential `whatsAppApi` + Phone-Number-ID\n- OpenAI-Credential\n- ERP-API-Credential (`httpHeaderAuth` oder OAuth2) + `ERP_BASE_URL`\n- PDFShift-Credential (Header `X-API-Key`)\n- Outlook-Credential (anderes Postfach als Classifier)\n- Whitelist-Telefonnummern in Funktion `Whitelist Check`\n- Workflow-IDs der beiden Sub-Workflows (`Sub: Send Offer WhatsApp`, `Sub: Send Offer Email`) in den Tool-Workflow-Nodes\n\n**Brand-Daten** werden in den Sub-Workflows gesetzt (Logo URL, Farbe, Adresse, USt-IdNr.).",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-720, -260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": ["messages"],
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "WhatsApp Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-400, 220],
      "webhookId": "whatsapp-offer-bot",
      "credentials": {
        "whatsAppTriggerApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME_WA_TRIGGER_CRED",
          "name": "WhatsApp Trigger (App Verify Token)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// --- Whitelist + Normalisierung ---\n// Erlaubte Telefonnummern (E.164 ohne +)\nconst WHITELIST = [\n  '491701234567',  // Mitarbeiter A\n  '491721234567',  // Mitarbeiter B\n  '491731234567'   // Mitarbeiter C\n];\n\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const data = item.json;\n  // n8n WhatsApp Trigger gibt typischerweise das normalisierte 'messages' Objekt im Webhook-Body zurueck\n  const msg = data.messages?.[0] || data.message || data;\n  const from = (msg.from || data.from || '').toString().replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  if (!WHITELIST.includes(from)) {\n    out.push({\n      json: {\n        allowed: false,\n        from,\n        reason: 'Nummer nicht autorisiert',\n        msg_id: msg.id,\n        type: msg.type\n      }\n    });\n    continue;\n  }\n  out.push({\n    json: {\n      allowed: true,\n      from,\n      msg_id: msg.id,\n      type: msg.type, // 'text' | 'audio' | 'image' | ...\n      text_body: msg.text?.body || '',\n      audio_id: msg.audio?.id || null,\n      audio_mime: msg.audio?.mime_type || null,\n      contact_name: data.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || data.profileName || ''\n    }\n  });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Whitelist + Normalize",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-180, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "allowed-cond",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.allowed }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": { "type": "boolean", "operation": "true", "singleValue": true }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
